  "fullDescription": "If you have an iPad and PROCREATE app, you’ll be happy to get realistic watercolor paint brushes for your artwork!\n\nUnlock the beauty of watercolor painting on your iPad with this comprehensive Watercolor Procreate Brushes set. Designed to give you the feel of real aquarelle, our brushes bring the fluidity, texture, and vibrance of traditional watercolors right to your digital canvas. Whether you’re working on delicate details, broad strokes, or textured backgrounds, this set includes everything you need to draw your watercolor masterpieces.\n\nFeatures:\n• 14 watercolor brushes for detailed drawing\n• 8 watercolor brushes for creating beautiful backgrounds\n• 8 additional watercolor brushes for unique effects\n• 9 paper textures to give your work an authentic, tactile feel\n• .brushset file with 39 brushes in total\n• .procreate file with 9 paper canvases\n\nWith 39 brushes in a single .brushset file and 9 paper canvases included in a .procreate file, you have all the tools necessary to capture every nuance of watercolour painting. Enjoy the process of creating with these realistic brushes, perfect for both detailed illustrations and expressive washes.\n\nHow To Use:\n1. Download the files on your iPad\n2. Click on .brushset files\n3. Procreate will automatically install all the brushes and they will appear at the top of your brush list",
